OL,3,AAt least 13 killed in Kyiv as Ukraine
OL,4,Agrapples with air defence shortages
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 13 people have been killed and
OL,7,F40 injured in the latest Russian
OL,8,Fstrikes targeting the Ukrainian
OL,9,Fcapital, Ukraine's prime minister said,
OL,10,Fas Kyiv continues to face a shortage of
OL,11,Fair defence missiles.
OL,13,FApartment blocks and warehouses were
OL,14,Fstruck across the city overnight, the
OL,15,FState Emergency Service of Ukraine
OL,16,Fsaid, while a children's hospital and
OL,17,Fschool were also damaged.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
