OL,3,AAt least 13 killed in Kyiv as Ukraine
OL,4,Agrapples with air defence shortages
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe deaths were the result of a
OL,7,Fshortage of air defence missiles,
OL,8,FUkrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky
OL,9,Fsaid, which Kyiv relies on western
OL,10,Fallies to supply.
OL,12,FSpeaking to BBC News at a wrecked
OL,13,Fapartment block in Kyiv, Mayor Vitali
OL,14,FKlitschko said Ukraine needed
OL,15,F"ammunition, anti-missile systems - we
OL,16,Fneed support from our partners".
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
